{"content_hash": "668ac409e3a72292", "version_id": 943, "article_id": 95, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 tops Steam weekly sales chart", "title_zh": "《使命召唤：现代战争4》登顶Steam周销量榜", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222184", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1672545701317-5177e9f41166?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fHN0ZWFtfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ0NTAxODh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Paul Crook on Unsplash", "author": "Paul Crook", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@goldenplover31?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-black-train-traveling-down-train-tracks-next-to-a-lush-green-field-HIPH-vbN8Kg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(264, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(302, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "2e082aa759d3"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-12", "word_count": 170, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Valve has published the latest Steam global sales ranking for the first week of November 2026. As usual, free-to-play games were left out, so the list is a better guide for people choosing games and hardware. Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 took first place, while Phantom Blade Zero came close behind.", "lead_zh": "Valve公布了2026年11月第一周的Steam全球销量排行榜。和往常一样，榜单没有计入免费游戏，所以更能帮玩家挑选游戏和硬件。《使命召唤：现代战争4》拿下第一，《影之刃零》紧随其后。", "preview": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 reached the top of the chart this week, although Valve did not share exact sales numbers. The shooter is one ", "preview_zh": "《使命召唤：现代战争4》本周登上榜首，不过Valve没有公布具体销量数字。这款射击游戏是这一季最大的新作之一，所以它拿第一并不让很多玩家意外。《影之刃零》排在第二，说明这款动作游戏在正式发售前已经受到很多关注。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 924, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 62.5, "size_bytes": 375984, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 64.825, "size_bytes": 389952, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 69.025, "size_bytes": 415152, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 59.875, "size_bytes": 360144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 63.9, "size_bytes": 384336, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@07e7785/content/data/versions/943.json", "paragraphs": ["Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 reached the top of the chart this week, although Valve did not share exact sales numbers. The shooter is one of the biggest releases of the season, so its first place did not surprise many players. Phantom Blade Zero finished second, which shows strong interest in the action game before its full launch.", "AION 2 landed in third place, because the online role-playing game has many fans in Asia. Football Manager 27 and EA SPORTS FC 27 also made the top ten, as football games usually sell well in the autumn. Meanwhile, the indie title Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen came fifth, which is a strong result for a smaller game.", "The rest of the list mixes old and new titles. Call of Duty, Final Fantasy 14, Moon Sweepers and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered filled the remaining places. Although free games were excluded, paid shooters and sports titles still dominated the chart. Valve said it will keep publishing the ranking every week."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《使命召唤：现代战争4》本周登上榜首，不过Valve没有公布具体销量数字。这款射击游戏是这一季最大的新作之一，所以它拿第一并不让很多玩家意外。《影之刃零》排在第二，说明这款动作游戏在正式发售前已经受到很多关注。", "《AION 2》位列第三，因为这款网络角色扮演游戏在亚洲有很多粉丝。《足球经理27》和《EA SPORTS FC 27》也进入了前十，因为足球游戏在秋天通常卖得很好。独立游戏《深空当铺：可能是偷的》排在第五，对小团队作品来说是很不错的成绩。", "榜单其余部分新旧作品混杂。《使命召唤》、《最终幻想14》、《Moon Sweepers》和《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》占据了剩下的位置。虽然免费游戏没有计入，付费射击游戏和体育游戏仍然主导榜单。Valve表示会继续每周发布这份排名。"], "body": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 reached the top of the chart this week, although Valve did not share exact sales numbers. The shooter is one of the biggest releases of the season, so its first place did not surprise many players. Phantom Blade Zero finished second, which shows strong interest in the action game before its full launch.\n\nAION 2 landed in third place, because the online role-playing game has many fans in Asia. Football Manager 27 and EA SPORTS FC 27 also made the top ten, as football games usually sell well in the autumn. Meanwhile, the indie title Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen came fifth, which is a strong result for a smaller game.\n\nThe rest of the list mixes old and new titles. Call of Duty, Final Fantasy 14, Moon Sweepers and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered filled the remaining places. Although free games were excluded, paid shooters and sports titles still dominated the chart. Valve said it will keep publishing the ranking every week.", "body_zh": "《使命召唤：现代战争4》本周登上榜首，不过Valve没有公布具体销量数字。这款射击游戏是这一季最大的新作之一，所以它拿第一并不让很多玩家意外。《影之刃零》排在第二，说明这款动作游戏在正式发售前已经受到很多关注。\n\n《AION 2》位列第三，因为这款网络角色扮演游戏在亚洲有很多粉丝。《足球经理27》和《EA SPORTS FC 27》也进入了前十，因为足球游戏在秋天通常卖得很好。独立游戏《深空当铺：可能是偷的》排在第五，对小团队作品来说是很不错的成绩。\n\n榜单其余部分新旧作品混杂。《使命召唤》、《最终幻想14》、《Moon Sweepers》和《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》占据了剩下的位置。虽然免费游戏没有计入，付费射击游戏和体育游戏仍然主导榜单。Valve表示会继续每周发布这份排名。", "text": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 reached the top of the chart this week, although Valve did not share exact sales numbers. The shooter is one of the biggest releases of the season, so its first place did not surprise many players. Phantom Blade Zero finished second, which shows strong interest in the action game before its full launch. AION 2 landed in third place, because the online role-playing game has many fans in Asia. Football Manager 27 and EA SPORTS FC 27 also made the top ten, as football games usually sell well in the autumn. Meanwhile, the indie title Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen came fifth, which is a strong result for a smaller game. The rest of the list mixes old and new titles. Call of Duty, Final Fantasy 14, Moon Sweepers and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered filled the remaining places. Although free games were excluded, paid shooters and sports titles still dominated the chart. Valve said it will keep publishing the ranking every week.", "vocab": [{"word": "ranking", "pos": "noun", "zh": "排行榜", "note": "常与 top / weekly 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "exclude", "pos": "verb", "zh": "排除", "note": "被动形式 be excluded 很常见", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "top the chart", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "登顶榜单", "note": "chart 指销量榜或音乐榜", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "noun", "zh": "新作；发行", "note": "也可作动词，表示发布", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "launch", "pos": "noun", "zh": "上市；发售", "note": "before its launch 表示发售前", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "land in", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "位列；排到", "note": "land in third place 排第三", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "indie", "pos": "adj", "zh": "独立制作的", "note": "指小团队独立游戏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dominate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "主导；占据优势", "note": "常用于市场或榜单", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "verb", "zh": "公布；分享", "note": "share numbers 公布数据", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "guide", "pos": "noun", "zh": "参考；指南", "note": "a guide for buyers 购买参考", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-12T02:23:06.579859", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Call", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.487, "sm": 275, "em": 487, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "of", "s": 0.487, "e": 0.575, "sm": 487, "em": 574, "cs": 5, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Duty", "s": 0.575, "e": 1.1, "sm": 575, "em": 1100, "cs": 8, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ":", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.237, "sm": 1100, "em": 1237, "cs": 12, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Modern", "s": 1.238, "e": 1.625, "sm": 1237, "em": 1624, "cs": 14, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Warfare", "s": 1.625, "e": 2.087, "sm": 1625, "em": 2087, "cs": 21, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "4", "s": 2.087, "e": 2.387, "sm": 2087, "em": 2387, "cs": 29, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "reached", "s": 2.388, "e": 2.662, "sm": 2387, "em": 2662, "cs": 31, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "the", "s": 2.663, "e": 2.75, "sm": 2662, "em": 2749, "cs": 39, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "top", "s": 2.75, "e": 2.987, "sm": 2750, "em": 2987, "cs": 43, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "of", "s": 2.987, "e": 3.062, "sm": 2987, "em": 3062, "cs": 47, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "the", "s": 3.062, "e": 3.15, "sm": 3062, "em": 3149, "cs": 50, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "chart", "s": 3.15, "e": 3.425, "sm": 3150, "em": 3424, "cs": 54, "ce": 59, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "this", "s": 3.425, "e": 3.6, "sm": 3425, "em": 3599, "cs": 60, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "week", "s": 3.6, "e": 4.125, "sm": 3600, "em": 4124, "cs": 65, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": ",", "s": 4